WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.275
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.375 --> 00:01.445
(All characters and organizations in this drama are fictional.)

3
00:01.445 --> 00:02.485
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

4
00:02.485 --> 00:03.585
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

5
00:04.585 --> 00:05.715
I told you to leave.

6
00:05.785 --> 00:07.148
(Episode 27)

7
00:07.863 --> 00:10.663
Who do you think you are? You are just a criminal.

8
00:11.233 --> 00:12.333
A criminal?

9
00:12.933 --> 00:16.173
Who is a criminal? Did you see me commit a crime?

10
00:17.143 --> 00:18.673
I did not see it, but I heard about it.

11
00:19.043 --> 00:20.743
If you want to pull a scam, do it alone.

12
00:20.813 --> 00:22.443
Why drag my dad into this?

13
00:22.443 --> 00:25.053
Do you know what mess my dad is in because of you?

14
00:27.353 --> 00:28.423
Who are you?

15
00:30.653 --> 00:34.453
I am Jang Hoon Tae's biological daughter.

16
00:34.763 --> 00:35.763
Got a problem with that?

17
00:40.193 --> 00:43.903
In all my life, I have never seen such a shameless scumbag.

18
00:44.663 --> 00:45.673
Of all people,

19
00:45.733 --> 00:47.933
you had to go to the man your mom remarried?

20
00:48.603 --> 00:49.973
Are you out of your mind?

21
00:50.203 --> 00:52.343
How did a total lunatic like you even get a medical license?

22
00:52.413 --> 00:53.713
Did you fake that too?

23
00:58.313 --> 00:59.583
If he's my mom's husband,

24
01:00.383 --> 01:01.583
then he's my dad too.

25
01:02.183 --> 01:04.793
- What? - My mom remarried him,

26
01:04.893 --> 01:05.993
so of course he's my dad.

27
01:06.653 --> 01:08.263
Unbelievable.

28
01:08.923 --> 01:11.833
You've got to be kidding me. Darn it.

29
01:12.933 --> 01:15.633
You guys have everything you could ever want,

30
01:15.703 --> 01:16.863
living in total luxury,

31
01:18.103 --> 01:20.303
so why couldn't he do that one little thing for me?

32
01:22.073 --> 01:23.573
You stole someone else's mother,

33
01:23.703 --> 01:25.143
and you and your dad enjoyed...

34
01:25.413 --> 01:27.313
all the love that should have been ours,

35
01:27.543 --> 01:28.683
yet he could not do that one favor?

36
01:28.813 --> 01:30.343
We stole her?

37
01:30.613 --> 01:31.853
How desperate must someone as good as her have been...

38
01:31.913 --> 01:33.913
to abandon her husband and children and leave?

39
01:33.983 --> 01:35.123
Did I kick her out?

40
01:35.583 --> 01:37.553
My dad messed up, so why take it out on me?

41
01:37.623 --> 01:39.793
Whatever. Forget it.

42
01:40.393 --> 01:42.593
We could argue about this all night and get nowhere,

43
01:42.663 --> 01:43.963
so just fix this yourself.

44
01:44.163 --> 01:46.463
Keep your trashy in-laws away from my dad,

45
01:46.533 --> 01:48.563
keep them away from my family...

46
01:48.903 --> 01:50.703
and make sure we don't get dragged into the mud with you.

47
01:50.763 --> 01:52.403
Take responsibility and put a stop to it.

48
01:52.473 --> 01:53.473
Darn it.

49
02:03.513 --> 02:05.653
So, how is she, Doctor?

50
02:06.613 --> 02:08.183
Look, Heung Sik.

51
02:08.553 --> 02:11.793
She said she's a doctor who specializes in amnesia.

52
02:12.023 --> 02:15.563
There's a way to cure her, right?

53
02:17.793 --> 02:19.493
No, there isn't.

54
02:20.263 --> 02:22.233
She has completely lost her mind.

55
02:22.403 --> 02:24.503
There's no answer or cure for this patient.

56
02:25.033 --> 02:26.703
What are we going to do?

57
02:27.503 --> 02:29.803
That poor girl has her whole life ahead of her.

58
02:29.873 --> 02:31.743
What should we do, Doctor?

59
02:31.813 --> 02:34.673
Please, you have to help her, Doctor.

60
02:35.083 --> 02:38.513
- Doctor. - Hey, what did the doctor say?

61
02:38.583 --> 02:40.213
She didn't catch on that you're faking, did she?

62
02:42.323 --> 02:44.053
Doctor, my foot.

63
02:46.323 --> 02:48.393
Come to think of it, she's a fraud too.

64
02:49.363 --> 02:51.993
What are you talking about? Speak plain English.

65
02:52.433 --> 02:54.493
That girl who just left isn't a doctor.

66
02:54.663 --> 02:57.733
She lied to Grandmother Su Nam just to meet me. She's a phony.

67
02:58.733 --> 02:59.733
What?

68
03:03.003 --> 03:05.473
Did that bastard Sung Wook send her to mess with you?

69
03:06.343 --> 03:07.373
Darn it.

70
03:07.743 --> 03:10.143
What kind of threats did they make to Chairman Jang?

71
03:18.453 --> 03:21.523
I've made up my mind, Heung Sik.

72
03:23.193 --> 03:26.433
She lost her memory like that and became a complete fool.

73
03:28.403 --> 03:31.533
I'm going to turn myself in and say I did it all.

74
03:32.103 --> 03:33.103
I'll confess,

75
03:33.403 --> 03:35.703
and tell her family to take her to a big hospital...

76
03:35.973 --> 03:38.003
so she can get proper treatment.

77
03:38.743 --> 03:40.813
You pretend you know nothing and stay out of it.

78
03:41.143 --> 03:42.213
Hold on.

79
03:43.113 --> 03:45.553
Why are you saying you did what I did?

80
03:45.753 --> 03:47.653
If anyone's turning themselves in, it should be me.

81
03:47.813 --> 03:48.853
Oh, really?

82
03:49.423 --> 03:51.383
Fine, then you go turn yourself in.

83
03:51.853 --> 03:55.193
I'll bring you food in prison every single day without fail.

84
03:56.763 --> 03:57.763
Mother.

85
04:00.263 --> 04:02.863
You little punk.

86
04:06.103 --> 04:07.373
If my child is precious to me,

87
04:07.433 --> 04:09.403
someone else's child is precious to them.

88
04:10.943 --> 04:13.513
Her family has no idea she's ended up like this,

89
04:13.573 --> 04:15.813
so confused and helpless. They cannot imagine it.

90
04:16.513 --> 04:18.383
Do you think she was just an ordinary girl?

91
04:18.453 --> 04:20.153
She was brilliant.

92
04:20.753 --> 04:23.783
She survived studying abroad and earned a doctorate,

93
04:24.253 --> 04:26.993
and after turning her into a total simpleton,

94
04:27.223 --> 04:28.763
how can we stand here so shamelessly?

95
04:28.823 --> 04:32.363
Are we even human? We're no better than animals.

96
04:32.433 --> 04:34.293
We're beasts, don't you see?

97
04:38.273 --> 04:41.743
I can barely breathe or sleep at night.

98
04:41.943 --> 04:45.773
This is pure sin. What on earth have we done?

99
04:54.053 --> 04:55.383
I have a son...

100
04:56.083 --> 04:57.583
named Gyeol.

101
04:59.753 --> 05:00.953
I love Mu Jin...

102
05:01.963 --> 05:03.493
as much as I love Gyeol.

103
05:05.463 --> 05:07.163
If Gyeol faces a difficult path,

104
05:08.233 --> 05:10.063
I will stand in front to lead him.

105
05:11.603 --> 05:13.003
And if Gyeol is happy,

106
05:13.733 --> 05:16.673
I will stand behind to support him.

107
05:21.573 --> 05:22.943
That is how...

108
05:25.453 --> 05:26.913
I love Mu Jin.

109
05:31.183 --> 05:32.623
Never again...

110
05:33.653 --> 05:37.723
will I be the one to let go of Mu Jin's hand.

111
05:41.233 --> 05:42.533
I am sorry.

112
05:46.903 --> 05:47.903
Unbelievable.

113
05:49.003 --> 05:50.073
Wait,

114
05:50.273 --> 05:53.113
did she say she loves Mu Jin like her own son?

115
05:53.713 --> 05:55.743
Then what about me?

116
05:55.883 --> 05:58.513
Is she saying that I don't love my own son or what?

117
05:58.583 --> 06:01.313
Is she claiming I'm not even a real mother?

118
06:01.783 --> 06:03.823
I don't think that's what she meant.

119
06:04.323 --> 06:05.753
She just means she loves Mu Jin...

120
06:06.053 --> 06:09.123
as deeply as she loves her own child...

121
06:09.593 --> 06:10.693
Hey,

122
06:10.893 --> 06:13.333
did you get a job as Han Gyu Rim's spokesperson?

123
06:15.533 --> 06:18.003
She said she would never be the one to let go...

124
06:18.063 --> 06:20.773
of Mu Jin's hand. Is that a declaration of war?

125
06:20.833 --> 06:22.203
How dare she be so arrogant?

126
06:23.603 --> 06:27.143
She will not back down. No matter how much you stomp on her,

127
06:27.213 --> 06:30.283
she is tougher than a weed. And on top of that,

128
06:30.783 --> 06:32.283
she still has the audacity...

129
06:32.353 --> 06:34.383
to talk back with whatever she wants to say.

130
06:35.883 --> 06:39.653
Parasite, bug, cockroach, leech.

131
06:41.023 --> 06:42.863
Mom, did you really say that to her?

132
06:42.923 --> 06:45.333
I did, and she felt no shame at all.

133
06:45.493 --> 06:48.163
She did not feel humiliated, and her pride was not even hurt.

134
06:48.633 --> 06:51.333
How can anyone have such thick skin?

135
06:51.663 --> 06:54.273
If they are that crazy about each other,

136
06:54.333 --> 06:57.443
if they love each other so much, can't you just leave them alone?

137
06:57.543 --> 07:02.143
- You promised you would, Mom. - Love, my foot.

138
07:02.583 --> 07:05.553
Where on earth does love like that exist?

139
07:06.183 --> 07:07.353
Listen to me, Kim Yoon Jin.

140
07:07.453 --> 07:09.883
If you take that girl's side one more time,

141
07:10.083 --> 07:12.353
I will throw you out without a single penny.

142
07:12.493 --> 07:14.153
Hey, is there...

143
07:14.293 --> 07:17.223
a dictionary of curse words somewhere?

144
07:17.623 --> 07:18.633
Darn it.

145
07:32.943 --> 07:34.313
Cute.

146
07:35.343 --> 07:37.983
Let us flirt after work.

147
07:38.713 --> 07:40.183
I do not want to.

148
07:43.283 --> 07:44.853
Do you know what time it is?

149
07:45.293 --> 07:49.063
Get it together, Chef Kim. This is no time to slack off.

150
07:50.393 --> 07:54.133
Then stop being so pretty.

151
07:56.403 --> 08:00.303
Wipe your eyes with this. What is so pretty about me?

152
08:00.573 --> 08:02.573
You clearly have never seen real beauty.

153
08:02.803 --> 08:05.003
No, really, what are you?

154
08:05.373 --> 08:07.973
How can someone look this pretty even with foam on their face?

155
08:09.243 --> 08:11.043
Did you drink a cafe latte?

156
08:11.783 --> 08:16.423
- Must have been good. - I said wipe your eyes, old man.

157
08:16.553 --> 08:17.823
Merry Christmas.

158
08:20.023 --> 08:21.493
Stop it.

159
08:27.363 --> 08:29.303
I fought with all my might to survive.

160
08:30.063 --> 08:33.733
Poverty is not my fault, Mu Jin.

161
08:34.873 --> 08:38.103
Starting now, I am going to be the villain.

162
08:39.213 --> 08:42.143
Without worrying about my place or knowing my limits,

163
08:42.713 --> 08:45.613
I will be shameless and brazen.

164
08:47.213 --> 08:50.323
Look at how much you love me.

165
09:00.293 --> 09:01.733
Keep that promise.

166
09:04.303 --> 09:05.503
Your promise...

167
09:07.033 --> 09:08.903
never to let go of my hand first,

168
09:09.973 --> 09:11.243
keep it no matter what.

169
09:13.773 --> 09:15.013
Then I will...

170
09:16.413 --> 09:18.343
keep my promise never to lose,

171
09:19.553 --> 09:21.013
my promise to win...

172
09:22.923 --> 09:24.183
at all costs.

173
09:45.103 --> 09:47.843
Even if the whole world criticizes and curses me,

174
09:48.343 --> 09:50.283
I will be honest about my feelings...

175
09:50.943 --> 09:52.553
and stand proud.

176
10:02.093 --> 10:03.093
What?

177
10:03.893 --> 10:07.363
You are the first to know. Congratulate us.

178
10:07.933 --> 10:09.103
This is crazy.

179
10:13.373 --> 10:14.773
You got married?

180
10:16.273 --> 10:17.573
Hee Na told you?

181
10:18.373 --> 10:22.943
Yes. I mean, wow.

182
10:23.343 --> 10:27.083
What's with the "Yes. I mean, wow"?

183
10:27.213 --> 10:29.683
I'm shocked, stunned, and thrilled.

184
10:31.583 --> 10:34.493
Congratulations. I really mean it.

185
10:35.863 --> 10:37.723
I'll tell them when the time is right,

186
10:37.793 --> 10:39.493
so keep it a secret from the family for now.

187
10:40.693 --> 10:42.233
Got it, got it.

188
10:44.663 --> 10:45.973
Has the bruise gone down?

189
10:46.803 --> 10:48.573
I told the family I got an eye infection.

190
10:49.103 --> 10:51.343
When are you going to tell me who beat you up?

191
10:52.013 --> 10:55.713
I told you, it wasn't a person. I got hit by a baseball bat.

192
10:58.653 --> 11:00.183
Do you take me for an idiot?

193
11:00.753 --> 11:02.953
I played along, and you think I actually bought it?

194
11:03.953 --> 11:07.253
- You were just pretending? - Give me his name within a week,

195
11:07.753 --> 11:09.493
before I track him down myself.

196
11:10.793 --> 11:12.433
Have a great life with Hee Na.

197
11:13.093 --> 11:15.263
Live so well that everyone in the world...

198
11:15.403 --> 11:16.703
cries tears of envy.

199
11:17.203 --> 11:18.403
Don't change the subject.

200
11:18.873 --> 11:20.273
I'm not changing the subject...

201
11:21.733 --> 11:25.443
I really want you to be happy. You and Gyu Rim being happy...

202
11:25.513 --> 11:27.143
should practically be mandated by law.

203
11:31.043 --> 11:33.053
So this is the wedding ring.

204
11:33.353 --> 11:36.683
- You're totally rocking it. - Looks awesome, right?

205
11:38.483 --> 11:40.753
What is this?

206
11:55.603 --> 11:58.203
(Seo Min Ju)

207
12:00.443 --> 12:01.443
Open the door.

208
12:17.023 --> 12:18.733
The gigolo who seduced my mom.

209
12:19.593 --> 12:21.393
That "bird" jerk you were on the phone with...

210
12:22.433 --> 12:23.633
It's Han Gyu Oh, isn't it?

211
12:24.663 --> 12:25.673
No.

212
12:27.133 --> 12:30.043
That's why you stood him up and avoided him at first.

213
12:30.303 --> 12:31.303
No.

214
12:31.373 --> 12:33.343
And why you freaked out and tried to stop Han Gyu Oh and me.

215
12:33.413 --> 12:35.073
My gosh.

216
12:36.013 --> 12:38.583
The pieces fit together so simply.

217
12:38.883 --> 12:40.283
How did I not see it before?

218
12:40.453 --> 12:42.523
I think you're misunderstanding something.

219
12:43.283 --> 12:45.523
Han Gyu Oh isn't a gigolo.

220
12:47.123 --> 12:49.763
Do you think I came here to ask because I didn't know that?

221
12:50.993 --> 12:53.133
I came today to put the final nail in your coffin.

222
12:53.893 --> 12:56.333
- Min Ju. - Where is Han Gyu Oh right now?

223
12:57.703 --> 13:00.103
My mom is desperate to see Han Gyu Oh.

224
13:01.303 --> 13:03.273
- Where is that bastard? - Hey.

225
13:05.073 --> 13:06.543
I changed my strategy.

226
13:07.843 --> 13:10.313
I'm going to get on my mom's good side,

227
13:10.683 --> 13:13.883
cater to her every whim, and inherit everything she has.

228
13:14.653 --> 13:16.023
So where is Han Gyu Oh?

229
13:16.953 --> 13:18.953
I have to go to work. Please leave.

230
13:22.923 --> 13:24.193
It's not like he vanished into thin air,

231
13:24.193 --> 13:25.793
or fell off the face of the earth,

232
13:26.063 --> 13:28.063
yet Su Chan and Yun Gi claim they don't know.

233
13:28.933 --> 13:30.803
Where is Han Gyu Oh?

234
13:39.473 --> 13:40.473
What's that?

235
13:41.113 --> 13:42.543
See this wedding ring?

236
13:43.343 --> 13:45.683
I married Gyu Oh.

237
13:47.013 --> 13:48.013
Are you crazy...

238
13:49.183 --> 13:52.893
- Are you kidding me? - Who jokes about marriage?

239
13:53.323 --> 13:54.553
Yesterday,

240
13:55.523 --> 13:59.063
in front of his grandparents, I married Gyu Oh,

241
14:00.093 --> 14:04.263
and he is my husband now. Whoever messes with my husband,

242
14:04.533 --> 14:07.773
no matter who or where they are, regardless of age or status,

243
14:07.833 --> 14:10.743
- I will destroy them all. - You really have lost your mind.

244
14:10.743 --> 14:13.273
The ones who lost their minds are you and your mom.

245
14:15.373 --> 14:18.343
There might not be any friendship left between us,

246
14:19.583 --> 14:21.413
but if there is even a shred of it left,

247
14:21.513 --> 14:22.523
I am begging you,

248
14:24.123 --> 14:27.023
please do not ever mess with Gyu Oh again.

249
14:37.433 --> 14:38.733
Mom, what do we do?

250
14:39.273 --> 14:42.073
Han Gyu Oh apparently married Kwon Hee Na.

251
14:53.713 --> 14:56.053
Gyeol, what if,

252
14:57.083 --> 14:58.323
just what if...

253
15:01.523 --> 15:04.063
What if I became your homeroom teacher's boyfriend?

254
15:05.523 --> 15:06.993
That would be so annoying.

255
15:07.393 --> 15:09.663
You asked me to tell you her name last time, too.

256
15:11.603 --> 15:13.733
Uncle, why do you keep bothering my teacher?

257
15:14.633 --> 15:17.373
Come on, you like Ms. Hee Na a lot, do you not?

258
15:17.673 --> 15:20.813
If your favorite teacher and your uncle became close friends,

259
15:20.943 --> 15:25.113
- would that not be even better? - No. Ms. Kwon Hee Na...

260
15:25.213 --> 15:26.213
is going to marry me later.

261
15:31.783 --> 15:34.493
Why would you marry your homeroom teacher?

262
15:34.553 --> 15:37.623
How old do you think you are? And what about Da Som?

263
15:40.033 --> 15:42.063
You said it yourself back then, Uncle.

264
15:42.663 --> 15:45.773
You told me you hated mixing your personal and professional life.

265
15:46.603 --> 15:47.903
That was then. You never know...

266
15:47.973 --> 15:49.043
how things will turn out between people.

267
15:49.243 --> 15:51.103
Anyway, I am totally against it.

268
15:51.543 --> 15:53.813
Do not have a crush on my teacher, Uncle.

269
15:54.313 --> 15:55.313
Never.

270
15:55.883 --> 15:57.013
Thank you for the food.

271
16:04.623 --> 16:05.623
Oh, my.

272
16:09.093 --> 16:10.323
Doing this after so long,

273
16:10.893 --> 16:12.163
my legs are killing me.

274
16:15.663 --> 16:17.633
Hey.

275
16:19.873 --> 16:22.373
I heard everything from here.

276
16:22.973 --> 16:25.003
Are you and your uncle in a love triangle?

277
16:25.403 --> 16:26.443
No.

278
16:27.313 --> 16:30.343
Right, family should not do that.

279
16:31.983 --> 16:33.383
Uncle is being really weird.

280
16:33.853 --> 16:35.753
He said he liked someone else before.

281
16:36.983 --> 16:40.423
That is why being devoted is so hard.

282
16:40.893 --> 16:43.763
Even Jeong Mong Ju was killed by Yi Bang Won for his loyalty.

283
16:44.093 --> 16:47.933
Looking at that, your mom is truly amazing.

284
16:48.463 --> 16:50.663
She has only had eyes for Kim Mu Jin.

285
16:51.403 --> 16:52.533
Mr. Mu Jin, too.

286
16:53.373 --> 16:55.133
He said from the day he met Mom,

287
16:55.273 --> 16:58.673
there has not been a single minute where he did not love her.

288
17:00.173 --> 17:01.943
How can you trust what a guy says...

289
17:02.513 --> 17:05.813
Hey. Even when you grow up,

290
17:06.453 --> 17:07.913
let us not get tangled up within the family.

291
17:09.183 --> 17:10.553
Intermarrying with in-laws or whatever,

292
17:10.883 --> 17:12.453
I really hate that kind of thing.

293
17:13.453 --> 17:15.693
Okay. But you know what?

294
17:16.423 --> 17:19.333
I liked Ms. Kwon Hee Na first.

295
17:19.433 --> 17:20.663
Out of everyone in my class, too.

296
17:21.033 --> 17:22.033
Really?

297
17:23.103 --> 17:24.103
You heard that, right?

298
17:24.733 --> 17:26.073
Gyeol liked her first.

299
17:26.973 --> 17:30.203
Gyu Oh, go find someone else.

300
17:30.903 --> 17:31.903
Right?

301
17:34.243 --> 17:35.413
The knees should not bulge out.

302
17:40.413 --> 17:42.013
Here, eat up.

303
17:49.423 --> 17:50.493
Han Gyu Young is...

304
17:50.493 --> 17:52.763
- at Grandma Su Nam's? - Yes.

305
17:52.833 --> 17:54.493
I am going to see Han Gyu Young after school.

306
17:56.063 --> 17:57.133
That is nice of you.

307
17:57.933 --> 17:59.003
Living at another's house must be lonely,

308
17:59.073 --> 18:00.133
rough, and overwhelming,

309
18:00.733 --> 18:03.173
- so help her out if you can. - What are you talking about?

310
18:03.243 --> 18:05.473
I am going over there to demand she pay your medical bills.

311
18:05.973 --> 18:08.243
Are you made of mush? The biggest pushover ever?

312
18:08.313 --> 18:09.343
Do you not have any backbone?

313
18:09.443 --> 18:10.913
Do you remember what Han Gyu Young did to us?

314
18:10.983 --> 18:13.413
You want to help that awful monster?

315
18:13.513 --> 18:15.013
Forget it. Just do not go.

316
18:15.953 --> 18:17.383
Let us pretend we never heard Gyu Young's story.

317
18:18.583 --> 18:20.823
Who do you take after to be such a softie?

318
18:20.993 --> 18:23.593
Not Dad. Dad is selfish and petty,

319
18:23.663 --> 18:25.363
the kind to run away at the first sign of injustice.

320
18:25.523 --> 18:27.033
- Then Mom... - Hey.

321
18:27.663 --> 18:31.633
- No way. Absolutely not that woman. - Do not even bring her up.

322
18:32.003 --> 18:33.403
Do not even speak the letter "M."

323
18:34.873 --> 18:38.273
Anyway, remember what Han Gyu Young did to us?

324
18:38.473 --> 18:40.173
Back in elementary school, when she was studying for exams,

325
18:40.243 --> 18:41.673
just because I shook a tambourine next to her,

326
18:41.743 --> 18:42.913
she smacked me on the head with it.

327
18:43.643 --> 18:46.453
It happened to you, too. She smacked your head just because...

328
18:46.513 --> 18:47.913
you ate all the ice cream she bought.

329
18:48.283 --> 18:49.423
Maybe both of us being dumb...

330
18:49.523 --> 18:50.723
is because we got hit on the head back then.

331
18:50.783 --> 18:51.823
Whatever.

332
18:53.093 --> 18:54.823
My ears hurt. Stop it.

333
18:55.493 --> 18:57.163
Thinking back on Han Gyu Young now,

334
18:57.523 --> 18:58.923
she was a total child-abusing criminal.

335
18:59.063 --> 19:00.533
She should be reported to the police.

336
19:01.093 --> 19:03.833
Let us report her, yes. Han Gyu Young did that?

337
19:04.133 --> 19:07.303
That vicious viper mistreated you and even beat you?

338
19:08.633 --> 19:10.443
Gyu Seo, what is this eye patch?

339
19:10.503 --> 19:12.403
Did Han Gyu Young do this to you too?

340
19:12.813 --> 19:15.313
What are you doing? Let us go to the police station.

341
19:15.373 --> 19:16.843
Fine. Let us go to the police station.

342
19:17.043 --> 19:18.613
I will make sure to report you for stalking,

343
19:18.743 --> 19:19.883
so come with me, lady.

344
19:20.253 --> 19:21.613
Wait...

345
19:22.483 --> 19:27.423
As a fan, hearing that you two...

346
19:27.493 --> 19:29.523
have been abused since you were kids,

347
19:29.663 --> 19:32.533
- I just got so mad. - Why are you eavesdropping on us?

348
19:33.093 --> 19:35.033
Why are you following us around in secret?

349
19:35.903 --> 19:37.933
What business is our family to you, like some kind of stalker?

350
19:38.403 --> 19:40.333
No, it is just...

351
19:40.433 --> 19:42.973
You two feel like my own children,

352
19:43.243 --> 19:44.503
and I am just being a supportive fan.

353
19:44.573 --> 19:45.643
Stop being our fan.

354
19:46.213 --> 19:48.013
We cannot stand fans like you,

355
19:48.473 --> 19:51.583
so if you follow us again, I will report you to the police.

356
19:51.583 --> 19:52.953
This is your only warning.

357
19:53.783 --> 19:55.083
Gyu Seo.

358
19:55.413 --> 19:58.923
Gyu Min, you understand how I feel, right?

359
19:59.423 --> 20:00.793
No, I do not.

360
20:01.293 --> 20:02.863
You know you are not normal, right?

361
20:03.363 --> 20:04.793
Han Gyu Seo, wait for me.

362
20:08.933 --> 20:10.503
Ungrateful brats...

363
20:10.503 --> 20:11.903
They don't even recognize their own mother.

364
20:15.473 --> 20:16.843
Han Gyu Young,

365
20:16.843 --> 20:19.173
that wicked girl has been nasty since she was little.

366
20:19.913 --> 20:22.583
What on earth did she do to harm my children?

367
20:28.983 --> 20:30.023
Can I come in?

368
20:31.083 --> 20:32.083
Yes.

369
20:35.453 --> 20:36.523
Where are you heading?

370
20:37.223 --> 20:38.263
To see Chairman Jang.

371
20:38.793 --> 20:39.793
Chairman Jang?

372
20:40.493 --> 20:42.803
- My mom's new husband. - Oh, I see.

373
20:46.573 --> 20:48.003
Please come with me.

374
20:49.133 --> 20:51.043
Sure, all right. Sure.

375
20:51.403 --> 20:54.513
From now on, we go everywhere together.

376
20:55.473 --> 20:58.483
First, let go of my hand.

377
21:02.183 --> 21:03.323
Do I have dirt on my hands?

378
21:04.953 --> 21:06.753
It is not that.

379
21:07.893 --> 21:10.193
Stop getting so touchy-feely with me.

380
21:10.263 --> 21:13.063
- You are a grown woman, seriously. - What does it matter?

381
21:13.533 --> 21:15.933
You said you would not bat an eye...

382
21:16.103 --> 21:17.403
even with 100 truckloads of girls like me.

383
21:17.503 --> 21:20.973
Even with 1,000 or 10,000 trucks, you said you would refuse.

384
21:21.633 --> 21:24.203
Well, that is true, but...

385
21:25.803 --> 21:28.113
What are you two doing in here...

386
21:31.313 --> 21:36.283
- Did she turn back into that vixen? - No, no. That is not it.

387
21:36.723 --> 21:39.293
She was just trying on her own clothes.

388
21:39.823 --> 21:41.693
Grandma, how do I look? Pretty, right?

389
21:41.993 --> 21:43.663
Yes, you are pretty.

390
21:44.423 --> 21:46.063
You couldn't be prettier.

391
21:46.933 --> 21:51.063
I just thought you were acting like that vixen again.

392
21:53.603 --> 21:55.103
What are we going to do?

393
21:55.433 --> 21:59.573
To such a fine young lady,

394
22:00.143 --> 22:02.683
what in the world are we doing right now?

395
22:04.883 --> 22:06.153
Didn't you say you would turn yourself in?

396
22:07.713 --> 22:08.713
I will.

397
22:09.753 --> 22:10.783
I am going to.

398
22:11.823 --> 22:13.293
Let us talk again after tonight.

399
22:13.353 --> 22:16.193
Enough. Stop stalling and turn yourself in.

400
22:16.363 --> 22:20.163
Since we are accomplices, let us split the blame in half.

401
22:20.433 --> 22:22.163
Come on, let us hurry up and go to the police...

402
22:22.233 --> 22:25.533
- Wait, hold on. - You wretched fool.

403
22:27.303 --> 22:28.903
Just give me some time first.

404
22:29.473 --> 22:30.843
There is something I need to take care of.

405
22:31.303 --> 22:33.473
You do nothing but fool around all day.

406
22:33.673 --> 22:35.013
What could you possibly need to do?

407
22:37.113 --> 22:38.143
I have...

408
22:39.083 --> 22:41.113
a medical condition I need to treat.

409
22:42.683 --> 22:44.353
Stop lying.

410
22:44.623 --> 22:47.893
You are strong as an ox. What condition?

411
22:50.523 --> 22:51.523
Hemorrhoids.

412
22:52.093 --> 22:53.133
Hemorrhoids?

413
22:54.093 --> 22:56.863
You know how nasty...

414
22:57.703 --> 22:58.903
and difficult this condition is, right?

415
22:59.573 --> 23:03.143
It is not like I am going to run away.

416
23:03.443 --> 23:06.713
I will turn myself in as you said and face the consequences.

417
23:08.913 --> 23:11.943
Just give me one week until it is treated.

418
23:13.353 --> 23:16.923
Am I really your mother? How could I not know about this?

419
23:17.053 --> 23:18.853
- How bad is the pain? - It hurts a lot.

420
23:18.923 --> 23:19.923
Hey, let me see.

421
23:19.993 --> 23:22.863
- Hold on. Come here. - My gosh.

422
23:23.663 --> 23:25.093
Wait a minute, wait.

423
23:29.933 --> 23:30.933
Thank you.

424
23:35.903 --> 23:37.273
You met with our Seo Hyun?

425
23:38.443 --> 23:39.443
Yes.

426
23:41.713 --> 23:43.243
I had no idea those people...

427
23:43.313 --> 23:45.013
would come and threaten you, Chairman Jang.

428
23:46.683 --> 23:48.113
I am sorry for causing trouble.

429
23:49.923 --> 23:51.053
Then...

430
23:51.123 --> 23:54.323
you left your home and are staying at his place? Together?

431
23:54.723 --> 23:57.223
We do not have that kind of relationship.

432
23:57.563 --> 23:59.533
My mother is also at the house.

433
24:00.333 --> 24:01.663
Anyway, my house...

434
24:01.733 --> 24:05.003
is just a temporary shelter, nothing more and nothing less.

435
24:05.363 --> 24:10.073
If I had to explain, I am her older sister Gyu Rim's...

436
24:10.143 --> 24:13.643
- platonic guy friend. Yes. - Those people...

437
24:13.813 --> 24:15.743
will not just sit by and do nothing.

438
24:16.283 --> 24:18.183
If they do not get what they want,

439
24:18.243 --> 24:19.883
they will do whatever it takes to harm me.

440
24:23.153 --> 24:24.353
Please save me.

441
24:28.653 --> 24:30.123
You said I was your daughter too.

442
24:30.763 --> 24:32.323
Act like a father, then.

443
24:32.623 --> 24:34.133
What are you talking about?

444
24:34.933 --> 24:36.733
Did you not come here to apologize and beg?

445
24:36.833 --> 24:38.863
Do not just call me your daughter in words.

446
24:39.233 --> 24:41.033
Show me what a real father does.

447
24:41.833 --> 24:46.273
Dealing with thugs like them should be nothing for you.

448
24:47.843 --> 24:48.843
Hey.

449
24:48.913 --> 24:51.483
Getting on your knees and begging wouldn't be enough,

450
24:51.483 --> 24:52.983
yet you made this mess, and now you want someone else...

451
24:52.983 --> 24:53.983
to take responsibility for it?

452
24:56.153 --> 24:58.923
Please understand, sir.

453
24:59.323 --> 25:01.353
She has been backed into a corner,

454
25:01.423 --> 25:04.323
so I think she has completely lost her mind. Yes.

455
25:05.323 --> 25:06.863
If word gets out about this marriage scam,

456
25:09.033 --> 25:11.033
and if people find out...

457
25:11.463 --> 25:13.333
it was not one-sided, but a mutual fraud,

458
25:14.973 --> 25:17.073
I am finished in this industry.

459
25:18.073 --> 25:19.573
I cannot fall apart like this.

460
25:20.273 --> 25:22.273
Do you know what it took for me to get here?

461
25:24.343 --> 25:26.753
- Gyu Young. - Please help me.

462
25:30.753 --> 25:32.283
How should I help you?

463
25:33.923 --> 25:35.853
Those people want money,

464
25:36.723 --> 25:40.993
so you want me to pay them, settle, and buy their silence. Is that it?

465
25:42.233 --> 25:43.463
However,

466
25:44.463 --> 25:46.033
I have no intention of giving them money.

467
25:46.903 --> 25:48.203
Not even a single won.

468
25:48.303 --> 25:50.673
- I will not give them anything. - Chairman Jang.

469
25:53.213 --> 25:54.213
Gyu Young.

470
25:55.343 --> 25:56.413
A lot of people,

471
25:56.513 --> 25:57.583
when they receive continuous kindness,

472
25:57.643 --> 26:00.483
mistake it for a right.

473
26:02.923 --> 26:05.453
I hope you aren't that kind of person.

474
26:09.323 --> 26:10.323
I am sorry.

475
26:10.863 --> 26:14.063
I have a meeting in five minutes. Please leave my office.

476
26:31.443 --> 26:32.613
The phone is off,

477
26:32.913 --> 26:34.553
so you will be connected to voicemail.

478
26:34.613 --> 26:36.823
Call charges will apply after the tone.

479
26:38.853 --> 26:41.093
Han Gyu Young, it is me.

480
26:42.323 --> 26:45.163
Why do you keep making me worry by leaving your phone turned off?

481
26:46.993 --> 26:49.533
You did not change your number to cut ties with us, did you?

482
26:53.333 --> 26:54.903
I am sorry to keep bothering you...

483
26:55.503 --> 26:57.303
after you told me to cut ties,

484
26:59.243 --> 27:00.743
but if you are alive,

485
27:02.173 --> 27:03.913
just send me a single dot to let me know.

486
27:05.443 --> 27:07.913
If you do that, I will never bother you again.

487
27:09.483 --> 27:10.883
Your message has been recorded.

488
27:15.423 --> 27:17.493
What is wrong? Is Gyu Young...

489
27:18.293 --> 27:21.133
Can you not get in touch with your sister?

490
27:26.503 --> 27:29.673
Give me her new home or work address,

491
27:29.743 --> 27:34.543
and I will go check on her. To see if she is alive or dead.

492
27:36.913 --> 27:39.513
They said she quit her hospital job,

493
27:41.183 --> 27:44.283
and I do not know her home address. She is supposed to be my sister,

494
27:44.883 --> 27:46.493
yet I do not know a single thing about her.

495
27:47.093 --> 27:48.623
What kind of sister am I?

496
28:03.243 --> 28:04.503
Do one with me, too.

497
28:07.813 --> 28:10.483
Let us do one together, an interview.

498
28:18.323 --> 28:20.023
If you are going to make up fake news...

499
28:20.093 --> 28:22.093
and completely ruin someone's business,

500
28:22.793 --> 28:25.593
giving me a chance to respond...

501
28:27.033 --> 28:29.733
is the kind of journalism you claim to practice, is it not?

502
28:32.703 --> 28:34.573
You must be Chef Kim Mu Jin.

503
28:35.733 --> 28:37.543
I never reported fake news.

504
28:38.073 --> 28:40.843
Are you using your privilege to silence the messenger?

505
28:41.413 --> 28:42.613
You know that this is...

506
28:42.673 --> 28:45.683
an outright suppression of the press and a threat, right?

507
28:45.943 --> 28:47.013
Privilege?

508
28:48.213 --> 28:50.283
No, I am just talking business here.

509
28:51.653 --> 28:53.823
You are not the type to settle for a few thousand dollars...

510
28:53.893 --> 28:56.323
- in ad revenue, are you? - What are you talking about?

511
28:57.693 --> 28:59.093
If it were me,

512
28:59.423 --> 29:01.893
and I was taking dirty money like that,

513
29:02.333 --> 29:03.333
I would...

514
29:03.403 --> 29:05.263
make this whole thing much bigger...

515
29:05.333 --> 29:07.633
and pick a far more aggressive fight.

516
29:07.703 --> 29:10.803
- Hey, what money did I... - That way,

517
29:11.903 --> 29:15.673
the client who paid you to frame me would really sweat,

518
29:15.743 --> 29:17.343
and shell out a lot more cash, wouldn't they?

519
29:18.983 --> 29:21.353
I think you could get...

520
29:22.283 --> 29:23.953
at least three times what you were paid.

521
29:24.383 --> 29:25.823
You jerk,

522
29:25.953 --> 29:27.493
do you want me to sue you for false accusation?

523
29:28.093 --> 29:29.193
Threatening a public figure...

524
29:29.293 --> 29:30.593
is aggravated intimidation, you know?

525
29:34.533 --> 29:35.563
Yes, Jung Woo.

526
29:37.003 --> 29:38.533
I don't think I want to do that interview.

527
29:39.333 --> 29:42.233
I just don't feel like it anymore. I don't want to show my face either.

528
29:43.543 --> 29:45.043
Thinking about it,

529
29:45.873 --> 29:47.643
it's only doing other people a favor.

530
29:49.643 --> 29:50.813
What are you talking about, out of nowhere?

531
29:50.883 --> 29:52.083
Hey, man,

532
29:52.413 --> 29:55.883
your family owns the second-largest abalone farm in Wando.

533
29:56.923 --> 30:00.123
Let's just close down the restaurant and go harvest abalones in Wando.

534
30:00.753 --> 30:02.353
I'm serious.

535
30:02.953 --> 30:06.163
We can harvest kelp and seaweed too. I'll be really good at it.

536
30:07.063 --> 30:08.563
Forget it. I'm not doing the interview.

537
30:08.633 --> 30:10.203
I really can't do it.

538
30:10.703 --> 30:11.763
Well, yes.

539
30:13.303 --> 30:14.403
Hey,

540
30:14.633 --> 30:16.903
if we shut down the restaurant, it's not like we're going to starve.

541
30:17.703 --> 30:18.943
Let's just head down to Wando.

542
30:19.773 --> 30:21.313
I can really harvest abalones well.

543
30:23.143 --> 30:24.343
Chef Kim Mu Jin,

544
30:24.613 --> 30:26.983
I hear you prepared something special for today?

545
30:28.013 --> 30:29.013
Yes.

546
30:31.953 --> 30:33.893
These are our restaurant's purchasing records,

547
30:33.953 --> 30:35.723
tax invoices, and complete transaction logs...

548
30:35.793 --> 30:37.023
from the past three years.

549
30:39.723 --> 30:43.093
And the origins of the ingredients you claimed I lied about,

550
30:43.333 --> 30:44.733
as well as the suppliers' contact info, are included,

551
30:44.803 --> 30:46.103
so feel free to verify them right away.

552
30:47.273 --> 30:51.043
As for reusing leftover food, I will release the unedited footage...

553
30:51.103 --> 30:54.213
from our kitchen's CCTV cameras with full transparency.

554
30:56.343 --> 31:00.453
In blind spots where the cameras can't reach,

555
31:00.513 --> 31:02.753
you could have secretly reused it there.

556
31:05.183 --> 31:07.123
On my name, I can assure you...

557
31:07.723 --> 31:08.923
that I have nothing to be ashamed of...

558
31:09.623 --> 31:10.923
when it comes to my cooking...

559
31:11.723 --> 31:13.493
or my conscience.

560
31:13.963 --> 31:15.893
I believe that because I stayed honorable in secret,

561
31:15.963 --> 31:17.503
our customers have trusted...

562
31:17.563 --> 31:19.703
my food all this time.

563
31:20.703 --> 31:22.133
Of course, I know that.

564
31:22.803 --> 31:24.573
How upright you are,

565
31:24.673 --> 31:27.313
- I can totally vouch for it. - Well, you see,

566
31:28.013 --> 31:31.713
internal CCTV footage can easily be manipulated and faked.

567
31:31.813 --> 31:33.853
Look at this half-chewed piece of pork rind.

568
31:33.913 --> 31:35.453
What is he blabbering about?

569
31:35.513 --> 31:37.223
From a criminal psychology standpoint,

570
31:37.353 --> 31:41.593
criminals are the ones who make a huge fuss,

571
31:41.653 --> 31:44.893
shoving CCTV footage, receipts, and alibis in your face.

572
31:45.123 --> 31:49.333
People who are truly innocent keep a dignified silence,

573
31:49.393 --> 31:50.633
as they say,

574
31:50.763 --> 31:53.833
because the truth will always come to light in the end.

575
32:01.113 --> 32:02.913
The truth isn't what matters to people like you.

576
32:03.013 --> 32:04.983
Wait, did you just drop honorifics with me?

577
32:05.443 --> 32:07.413
A piece of trash like you doesn't even deserve polite words.

578
32:07.483 --> 32:08.653
A piece of trash?

579
32:09.083 --> 32:10.623
Yes, a piece of trash like you.

580
32:11.783 --> 32:13.723
Picking a target, spreading fake news,

581
32:13.793 --> 32:15.923
mocking, crushing, and destroying lives,

582
32:16.093 --> 32:18.193
all just to rake in dirty money, you scumbag.

583
32:18.263 --> 32:19.323
Hey, cut the feed. Turn it off now.

584
32:19.393 --> 32:21.363
Turn off what? You pathetic insect, you pest.

585
32:21.433 --> 32:23.063
(The live stream has ended. Thank you for watching.)

586
32:26.003 --> 32:27.003
What?

587
32:28.633 --> 32:30.303
Mu Jin did what?

588
32:31.243 --> 32:33.373
I was in class, so I couldn't watch the stream,

589
32:33.443 --> 32:34.973
but the comments are completely divided.

590
32:35.973 --> 32:38.543
It is literally split down the middle.

591
32:38.713 --> 32:40.283
Criticism for what?

592
32:40.953 --> 32:45.153
Why is it split? Isn't that YouTuber totally shady?

593
32:46.083 --> 32:47.723
He always ruins people's lives with fake news,

594
32:47.793 --> 32:49.553
and it's not even the first time.

595
32:51.123 --> 32:52.823
Can't people tell just by looking at Mu Jin?

596
32:53.733 --> 32:56.033
Can't they see he is not the kind of person who lies?

597
32:56.333 --> 32:57.433
Well, you see...

598
32:57.533 --> 33:00.803
Mu Jin got really worked up, so he started cursing on stream...

599
33:00.933 --> 33:02.133
He made quite a scene.

600
33:02.933 --> 33:04.643
Anyway, the CEO of our restaurant...

601
33:04.703 --> 33:07.243
is filing complaints and lawsuits, digging deep into everything,

602
33:07.313 --> 33:08.673
so the real culprit will be exposed soon.

603
33:10.583 --> 33:11.883
Jung Woo...

604
33:12.683 --> 33:14.353
is filing complaints and lawsuits?

605
33:16.583 --> 33:18.883
- He is digging into it? - Yes.

606
33:18.953 --> 33:20.793
He used to be a lawyer, remember?

607
33:20.923 --> 33:23.023
He said the employee couldn't have acted alone,

608
33:23.093 --> 33:24.523
and there has to be someone pulling the strings.

609
33:24.623 --> 33:26.193
He says he will track them down soon.

610
33:27.293 --> 33:30.403
Gyu Rim, I have to get to class. I will call you later.

611
33:34.473 --> 33:35.903
It was me.

612
33:36.573 --> 33:39.073
I wanted my son Mu Jin...

613
33:39.143 --> 33:41.313
to lose absolutely everything. So I...

614
33:42.343 --> 33:44.643
paid those people to do all of it.

615
33:47.083 --> 33:50.123
(Suragan Side Dishes)

616
33:56.423 --> 33:58.523
"Totally get why he's pissed."

617
34:00.633 --> 34:02.393
"If it were me, I'd have knocked him out..."

618
34:02.463 --> 34:04.163
"and flipped the whole place over."

619
34:05.103 --> 34:07.473
"Rage level 200 percent."

620
34:08.173 --> 34:10.303
"Certified master of digging his own grave."

621
34:10.373 --> 34:11.543
Darn it.

622
34:11.643 --> 34:12.843
(Rage Level 200 Percent)

623
34:12.903 --> 34:14.143
(Certified Master of Digging His Own Grave)

624
34:19.313 --> 34:21.053
I worried you might, but seriously...

625
34:22.213 --> 34:23.923
I never thought you'd actually go on his stream.

626
34:24.723 --> 34:26.123
Why do you always have to go head-on...

627
34:26.183 --> 34:29.093
- into everything like this? - If you stay quiet,

628
34:29.653 --> 34:30.863
people just walk all over you.

629
34:35.463 --> 34:36.863
I'm a human being, not a doormat.

630
34:56.053 --> 34:57.053
Honestly...

631
34:58.053 --> 35:00.293
I would rather Mu Jin lost everything.

632
35:00.893 --> 35:01.893
Pardon?

633
35:02.193 --> 35:05.063
The poorer he is, the better it is for me.

634
35:06.593 --> 35:07.593
What do you mean?

635
35:08.593 --> 35:10.063
If he can't make a living,

636
35:10.803 --> 35:12.163
I can just provide for him.

637
35:14.733 --> 35:17.343
I wouldn't be accused of overstepping,

638
35:17.343 --> 35:19.303
or wrongfully suspected of going after his money.

639
35:19.943 --> 35:21.913
I would not have to feel...

640
35:22.943 --> 35:24.113
shame or humiliation.

641
35:24.813 --> 35:27.013
Without feeling servile or intimidated,

642
35:27.383 --> 35:30.013
I will be able to love Mu Jin with much more confidence,

643
35:30.983 --> 35:32.353
and that makes me so happy.

644
35:36.963 --> 35:38.263
If I had known that a poor woman...

645
35:39.863 --> 35:41.633
loving a wealthy heir...

646
35:43.163 --> 35:45.163
would be this devastating,

647
35:47.633 --> 35:49.633
I would have run to the ends of the earth...

648
35:50.603 --> 35:51.943
and hidden myself away.

649
35:55.143 --> 35:56.773
Now, there is no turning back.

650
35:58.913 --> 36:00.853
No matter what unfair misunderstandings I face,

651
36:02.053 --> 36:05.323
even if the shame and humiliation make me want to die,

652
36:07.593 --> 36:10.363
I will never stop loving Mu Jin.

653
36:25.043 --> 36:27.613
I might even pray for him to go broke soon.

654
36:29.973 --> 36:32.113
Poor Mu Jin knows nothing about this...

655
36:33.713 --> 36:34.883
Won't you please...

656
36:35.983 --> 36:37.383
protect him?

657
36:45.763 --> 36:46.823
Enjoy your meal.

658
37:01.143 --> 37:03.543
We are not young anymore.

659
37:04.913 --> 37:08.283
If you keep living like that, you could drop dead in a heartbeat.

660
37:08.913 --> 37:10.113
Life can change overnight.

661
37:12.153 --> 37:13.153
Are you...

662
37:13.993 --> 37:15.753
in a bad mood again today?

663
37:18.193 --> 37:20.863
Should I show you a trick again?

664
37:21.793 --> 37:22.993
All right, look here.

665
37:25.903 --> 37:28.303
Here, Seon, look.

666
37:29.173 --> 37:30.943
Here is 50 cents.

667
37:39.883 --> 37:40.953
Ta-da.

668
37:42.083 --> 37:43.083
Seok Joong.

669
37:43.753 --> 37:44.753
Yes?

670
37:45.353 --> 37:46.483
I am Hong Ok Seon.

671
37:47.793 --> 37:48.923
Are we introducing ourselves now?

672
37:49.453 --> 37:50.493
I am Han Seok Joong.

673
37:51.063 --> 37:52.093
I am never wrong.

674
37:52.763 --> 37:55.033
I have never been wrong in my entire life.

675
37:55.563 --> 37:57.103
I am always right.

676
37:58.263 --> 38:02.333
I really admire your confidence.

677
38:02.403 --> 38:03.603
It is totally awesome.

678
38:04.243 --> 38:06.673
In the end, he will understand...

679
38:08.243 --> 38:10.043
why I had no choice but to do this.

680
38:12.343 --> 38:13.483
Because he is my child.

681
38:14.153 --> 38:15.183
Because he is my son.

682
38:16.753 --> 38:18.653
Is your son giving you a hard time again?

683
38:19.523 --> 38:21.153
Hey, give me his name and phone number.

684
38:21.223 --> 38:22.693
I will meet him and give him a piece of my mind.

685
38:25.223 --> 38:28.633
Either way, we must stay healthy,

686
38:28.693 --> 38:31.863
keep going, and stay alive. I always tell you,

687
38:31.933 --> 38:34.873
if we lose our health, we lose everything.

688
38:36.233 --> 38:37.603
Earlier, the owner gave you...

689
38:37.673 --> 38:39.803
that protein powder for being a ten-year regular...

690
38:39.973 --> 38:43.413
Make sure you don't skip it and drink it regularly.

691
38:44.313 --> 38:46.213
This?

692
38:46.513 --> 38:48.313
Yes, yes, this one right here.

693
38:48.553 --> 38:51.253
Hey, since we are talking about it, drink it now, okay?

694
38:53.723 --> 38:54.723
Here.

695
38:55.023 --> 38:57.663
Didn't you say your arms and legs felt weak lately?

696
38:57.893 --> 39:01.133
A lot of my friends take this, too.

697
39:01.963 --> 39:02.993
I will mix it for you.

698
39:13.273 --> 39:16.013
Here, try it. I bet it is really nutty and good.

699
39:16.643 --> 39:17.643
All right.

700
39:18.513 --> 39:20.353
Let's drink this and get our energy up.

701
39:22.283 --> 39:26.353
- Hey, have some too. - Sure, thanks, my friend.

702
39:26.923 --> 39:29.323
All right. I will get some water for myself.

703
39:31.093 --> 39:34.293
Right, let us drink and stay strong, Hong Ok Seon.

704
39:34.833 --> 39:37.163
I would not have started if I were going to give up here.

705
39:40.033 --> 39:41.033
There.

706
39:42.733 --> 39:43.743
Yes.

707
39:46.703 --> 39:47.773
All right, that's enough, that is enough.

708
39:54.113 --> 39:55.113
Thanks, friend.

709
39:57.223 --> 39:58.223
Here, drink.

710
39:58.483 --> 40:02.023
I heard young people nowadays drink this a lot to stay fit.

711
40:02.353 --> 40:03.963
They say it tones up your body.

712
40:05.093 --> 40:08.163
Either way, at our age, muscle is everything.

713
40:08.963 --> 40:10.403
All right, cheers for real.

714
40:11.933 --> 40:12.933
Cheers.

715
40:16.573 --> 40:18.143
Let us drink this and cheer up, Seon, okay?

716
40:18.203 --> 40:20.243
- You are the sun. - All right.

717
40:21.043 --> 40:23.713
The sun to your son, and the sun to Han Seok Joong.

718
40:24.643 --> 40:28.683
If the sun falls sick and lies down, the Earth is doomed.

719
40:31.123 --> 40:32.123
Seok Joong.

720
40:33.183 --> 40:34.193
Yes?

721
40:35.093 --> 40:36.353
Why do you not...

722
40:37.223 --> 40:38.593
sound cheesy at all?

723
40:39.723 --> 40:40.793
The things you say,

724
40:41.433 --> 40:42.663
the things you do.

725
40:44.303 --> 40:45.533
The old me...

726
40:46.833 --> 40:50.503
would have found it so cringey that I could not stand it.

727
40:53.203 --> 40:54.213
Why is this happening?

728
40:57.913 --> 40:58.913
Why?

729
40:59.713 --> 41:01.653
Do you feel touched and find me cute?

730
41:03.053 --> 41:04.053
You are in trouble.

731
41:04.923 --> 41:06.383
You have fallen for me.

732
41:07.993 --> 41:09.453
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

733
41:14.033 --> 41:15.663
You said you would be running the place...

734
41:15.663 --> 41:16.733
yourself starting today, right?

735
41:17.563 --> 41:19.263
Congratulations, Ms. Go Yoon Hee.

736
41:20.033 --> 41:21.573
I know you will do great.

737
41:22.273 --> 41:24.403
If anything gets tough, feel free to ask me anytime.

738
41:24.903 --> 41:27.543
Always rooting for you and supporting you,

739
41:27.943 --> 41:29.273
Jang Hoon Tae.

740
41:33.913 --> 41:35.013
Excuse me.

741
41:35.983 --> 41:38.523
- Yes? - Just a moment.

742
41:38.583 --> 41:39.723
Yes, ma'am.

743
41:42.753 --> 41:43.753
How can I help you?

744
41:47.233 --> 41:49.063
Would you sit down for a second?

745
41:50.433 --> 41:53.563
Is there something wrong with your food?

746
41:53.633 --> 41:56.573
No, no, not at all.

747
41:56.873 --> 41:59.803
The meat is delicious, and the vegetables are very fresh.

748
42:00.973 --> 42:02.513
It is just...

749
42:02.913 --> 42:05.683
I wanted to talk to you in private.

750
42:11.583 --> 42:12.623
Have we...

751
42:13.423 --> 42:15.053
met somewhere before?

752
42:16.623 --> 42:18.663
You look familiar,

753
42:19.463 --> 42:21.393
though I do not think you are a regular.

754
42:27.333 --> 42:29.833
It is me, Geum Ju.

755
42:30.543 --> 42:31.543
Lee Geum Ju.

756
42:33.103 --> 42:36.443
The sister of your best friend, Geum Jeong.

757
42:38.243 --> 42:39.713
Things happened,

758
42:40.313 --> 42:43.413
so I got a complete facial reconstruction...

759
42:43.783 --> 42:48.023
and changed my name. Call me Eun Ok from now on.

760
42:50.693 --> 42:52.923
Through Geum Jeong,

761
42:53.693 --> 42:56.693
I have been hearing updates about you and Seok Joong...

762
42:56.963 --> 43:00.463
in real time. I heard...

763
43:01.903 --> 43:04.043
you remarried a rich guy.

764
43:05.073 --> 43:06.273
And that your new husband...

765
43:06.903 --> 43:10.343
is the whole package, as kids these days say?

766
43:18.183 --> 43:19.223
I know...

767
43:20.253 --> 43:21.293
that I committed...

768
43:21.923 --> 43:24.423
an unforgivable sin against you,

769
43:26.723 --> 43:28.633
but honestly, in the end,

770
43:29.563 --> 43:32.103
shouldn't you be a little grateful to me?

771
43:39.873 --> 43:41.843
Every time lightning struck, I prayed.

772
43:44.343 --> 43:46.883
I prayed that bolt would strike you down.

773
43:48.513 --> 43:50.583
That misfortune would follow your every step.

774
43:51.783 --> 43:54.153
That you would be betrayed by the one you trusted most,

775
43:55.493 --> 43:57.323
and that whatever you held most dear...

776
43:57.393 --> 43:59.093
would be brutally ripped away from you.

777
44:02.333 --> 44:03.963
I prayed that you would suffer...

778
44:05.533 --> 44:07.703
the exact same thing I did 17 years ago.

779
44:11.003 --> 44:12.303
Yoon Hee.

780
44:20.313 --> 44:22.653
They seem to be in the middle of a serious talk.

781
44:22.713 --> 44:23.853
(Congratulations on the Grand Opening)

782
44:23.913 --> 44:24.923
Yes.

783
44:25.653 --> 44:26.783
Let us come back later.

784
44:27.953 --> 44:28.953
Okay.

785
44:38.303 --> 44:40.933
I do not know what kind of nerve brought you here,

786
44:42.073 --> 44:44.143
but today is an important day for me.

787
44:48.043 --> 44:49.573
I am sick of hating you,

788
44:51.243 --> 44:53.683
and frankly, I am sick of being angry.

789
44:59.123 --> 45:01.193
I just want to erase it all and live my life,

790
45:02.523 --> 45:03.693
so eat quietly and leave.

791
45:05.063 --> 45:07.433
I want to live with Seok Joong again.

792
45:10.803 --> 45:13.963
I want to be where my babies are, grow old with them,

793
45:14.503 --> 45:15.873
and die there.

794
45:20.243 --> 45:24.943
Help me, Yoon Hee. Please help me.

795
45:25.913 --> 45:27.383
I am begging you, Yoon Hee.

796
45:33.553 --> 45:35.053
Yoon Hee.

797
45:36.723 --> 45:38.563
Hello.

798
45:47.473 --> 45:48.673
Where is Han Gyu Oh right now?

799
45:49.903 --> 45:52.243
My mom is desperate to see Han Gyu Oh.

800
45:53.403 --> 45:54.413
Where is that bastard?

801
46:12.923 --> 46:13.923
Ma'am.

802
46:16.133 --> 46:17.633
Where is Han Gyu Oh?

803
46:19.803 --> 46:21.533
I asked where Han Gyu Oh is.

804
46:25.603 --> 46:26.603
I do not know.

805
46:27.403 --> 46:28.413
You do not know?

806
46:29.143 --> 46:32.083
You do not even know where your husband is?

807
46:32.913 --> 46:34.153
I heard you married that con artist gigolo.

808
46:34.213 --> 46:35.213
Is that true?

809
46:36.713 --> 46:40.283
Knowing full well he is a criminal, you still fooled around with him?

810
46:40.453 --> 46:41.793
And on top of that, you married him?

811
46:42.293 --> 46:43.753
A schoolteacher, someone who should set an example...

812
46:43.823 --> 46:45.423
for others, acting like this.

813
46:49.893 --> 46:52.733
He is not a criminal.

814
46:56.033 --> 46:57.033
Unbelievable.

815
46:57.703 --> 47:00.173
You look so innocent on the outside.

816
47:00.703 --> 47:01.873
Does your school know?

817
47:02.873 --> 47:04.283
Do the parents know?

818
47:05.913 --> 47:08.413
From a deceitful witch like you,

819
47:08.483 --> 47:11.423
what could young, growing minds possibly learn?

820
47:52.893 --> 47:54.733
We're setting up the display.

821
47:54.793 --> 47:56.133
Which color do you want between these two?

822
47:56.293 --> 47:57.293
You've got to decide.

823
47:58.303 --> 47:59.663
I like this color better.

824
48:01.303 --> 48:03.473
Wait, I just asked you to pick between these two,

825
48:03.533 --> 48:06.003
so why are you picking a random color out of nowhere?

826
48:06.273 --> 48:07.273
Han Gyu Oh.

827
48:08.543 --> 48:10.113
What the?

828
48:13.543 --> 48:15.313
Wait, why is your face so pale?

829
48:16.083 --> 48:17.553
And why are your lips so red?

830
48:17.953 --> 48:18.953
Really?

831
48:19.483 --> 48:20.953
I put my makeup on in the dark.

832
48:21.923 --> 48:24.423
I thought you were in Kabuki theater.

833
48:24.823 --> 48:26.793
Wait, didn't you say you were seeing an old friend today?

834
48:28.133 --> 48:29.863
I missed you so much that I ditched them.

835
48:30.633 --> 48:31.833
Can you give me a hug?

836
48:32.963 --> 48:34.063
Wait a minute.

837
48:34.603 --> 48:37.003
In here? Not in here.

838
48:37.073 --> 48:38.773
Don't do that.

839
48:44.413 --> 48:47.483
Hey, what if customers walk in?

840
48:47.543 --> 48:49.453
People outside can see everything right now.

841
48:50.383 --> 48:51.383
Hey, break it up.

842
48:52.553 --> 48:53.553
Get off each other.

843
48:56.123 --> 48:59.363
Are you two trying to ruin my business or what?

844
48:59.593 --> 49:01.963
Break it up. Let go of each other.

845
49:03.693 --> 49:05.863
Yes, I understand.

846
49:05.933 --> 49:09.673
Anyway, as you've probably heard from CEO Jung,

847
49:10.573 --> 49:11.603
this whole thing...

848
49:12.043 --> 49:14.143
involves someone convicted 4 times, another 3 times, and their son.

849
49:14.203 --> 49:16.443
The whole family plotted this marriage scam.

850
49:16.913 --> 49:18.013
So for our part,

851
49:18.413 --> 49:20.783
let's charge them with fraud, extortion, threats, and assault...

852
49:21.383 --> 49:22.813
both civil and criminal,

853
49:22.883 --> 49:24.753
everything we can hit them with. Understood?

854
49:25.183 --> 49:26.453
Don't worry about the cost.

855
49:27.083 --> 49:28.093
Let's take this all the way.

856
49:28.823 --> 49:31.193
And they're definitely going to try...

857
49:31.263 --> 49:34.693
to claim mutual liability. If that happens,

858
49:34.693 --> 49:36.493
I'll take full responsibility for it,

859
49:37.263 --> 49:39.633
so the most important thing is...

860
49:40.163 --> 49:42.033
to make sure my daughter Gyu Young's name never comes up.

861
49:42.303 --> 49:44.073
Please pay special attention to that.

862
49:44.643 --> 49:46.343
- Yes, of course. - All right.

863
49:47.343 --> 49:48.343
Yes?

864
49:50.273 --> 49:52.043
Director Kim Yoon Jin is here to see you.

865
49:53.783 --> 49:54.783
Director Kim Yoon Jin?

866
49:56.753 --> 49:57.753
Let's wrap it up here.

867
50:03.193 --> 50:05.623
Has your mother lost her mind?

868
50:07.193 --> 50:09.993
She would go that far just to tear Gyu Rim away?

869
50:11.203 --> 50:13.863
You know that once my mom sets her mind on something,

870
50:13.933 --> 50:15.803
she's like a car with broken brakes.

871
50:16.233 --> 50:18.403
Even if she knows she's completely wrong,

872
50:18.473 --> 50:21.343
- she'll never stop. - I know, but...

873
50:21.813 --> 50:23.673
Even if her brakes are broken,

874
50:23.743 --> 50:25.343
shouldn't she at least keep a firm grip on the wheel?

875
50:25.413 --> 50:26.413
She needs to steer straight.

876
50:26.843 --> 50:28.283
Does she think this is the right road to take?

877
50:29.483 --> 50:31.223
You're the only one who can stop her,

878
50:31.283 --> 50:33.583
so I thought about it a lot before coming to see you.

879
50:34.523 --> 50:35.523
I see.

880
50:37.793 --> 50:40.563
Han Gyu Rim is a truly good person.

881
50:42.263 --> 50:44.063
Even if Mu Jin ended up with nothing,

882
50:44.163 --> 50:47.633
she would stand by him. She would never leave him.

883
50:50.073 --> 50:51.073
Of course she wouldn't.

884
50:52.903 --> 50:55.343
I'm relieved that at least you see that.

885
50:56.743 --> 51:00.743
Gyu Rim is an upright, wonderful person.

886
51:02.053 --> 51:03.683
She might be one of a kind in this world.

887
51:05.483 --> 51:07.083
I'm sorry to say this in front of you,

888
51:07.993 --> 51:09.993
but if your mother wanted to match her character,

889
51:10.053 --> 51:12.563
even on a bullet train, she could never catch up.

890
51:15.893 --> 51:18.363
Anyway, thank you for telling me.

891
51:19.763 --> 51:21.003
Go on back to your work.

892
51:22.803 --> 51:23.973
I'll handle it.

893
51:25.443 --> 51:28.313
- All right. - Please take good care of it.

894
51:28.443 --> 51:30.013
Yes, of course. Don't worry about seeing me out.

895
51:30.073 --> 51:31.083
Okay.

896
51:39.323 --> 51:40.323
Hong Ok Seon...

897
51:41.793 --> 51:43.823
Are you really picking a fight with me?

898
51:56.733 --> 51:59.543
(Wando Sea Bream Capellini Pasta)

899
52:05.143 --> 52:07.853
(Gyu Rim)

900
52:09.013 --> 52:10.013
Hello?

901
52:21.133 --> 52:22.563
There are no customers.

902
52:23.233 --> 52:24.503
Not a single one.

903
52:27.203 --> 52:30.703
I think our restaurant is going under.

904
52:32.703 --> 52:34.773
There's still plenty of time before closing.

905
52:35.273 --> 52:36.473
People might come later.

906
52:39.613 --> 52:43.783
Until I call you, don't send any abalone for now.

907
52:45.183 --> 52:47.723
Nothing is wrong, but...

908
52:48.623 --> 52:49.893
Also...

909
52:50.123 --> 52:54.963
if you need extra hands at the farm, please let me know.

910
52:56.493 --> 52:57.633
Well, you see,

911
52:58.403 --> 53:02.233
I know 1 or 2 guys who may soon be out of work.

912
53:06.673 --> 53:10.273
Mother, I'm a bit busy right now.

913
53:11.013 --> 53:12.643
I'll call you back later.

914
53:13.213 --> 53:15.383
Go feed the dog, Mother.

915
53:16.653 --> 53:17.653
Okay.

916
53:32.833 --> 53:34.633
Why have you been sighing this whole time?

917
53:37.203 --> 53:38.243
What about you?

918
53:38.803 --> 53:41.413
How did your meeting with Han Gyu Young go?

919
53:42.473 --> 53:44.243
Took you long enough to ask.

920
53:44.513 --> 53:46.583
Isn't that why you wanted to see me?

921
53:46.713 --> 53:48.213
Defying your fiancée's strict orders?

922
53:48.353 --> 53:50.183
She's not my fiancée yet.

923
53:50.713 --> 53:51.723
Hey,

924
53:52.223 --> 53:54.083
even if things are over between you and Mu Jin,

925
53:54.153 --> 53:57.553
how can you just cut him off so coldly...

926
53:57.793 --> 54:00.393
without caring about him at all?

927
54:01.333 --> 54:05.133
Where is this coming from? We were talking about Han Gyu Young,

928
54:05.203 --> 54:08.203
so why bring up Mu Jin? Because of Han Gyu Rim?

929
54:08.573 --> 54:10.003
Don't you ever watch the news?

930
54:10.433 --> 54:12.173
Haven't you heard the news about our restaurant?

931
54:12.603 --> 54:14.243
What? What news?

932
54:14.503 --> 54:18.043
During our busiest hours, doesn't it strike you as odd...

933
54:18.343 --> 54:20.283
that I'm just sitting here with you?

934
54:21.953 --> 54:23.353
How can you be so clueless?

935
54:25.153 --> 54:26.853
Wait,

936
54:27.683 --> 54:28.723
why aren't you busy?

937
54:55.553 --> 54:56.613
Chef Kim,

938
54:57.113 --> 54:59.383
we just got a reservation call.

939
54:59.653 --> 55:02.153
They said they'll be here in 20 minutes.

940
55:02.953 --> 55:04.153
It is 20 plus 1...

941
55:04.223 --> 55:05.923
That means 21 guests are coming.

942
55:07.363 --> 55:08.363
Right now?

943
55:08.663 --> 55:09.663
Yes, right now.

944
55:13.733 --> 55:16.103
- Got it. - Good luck.

945
55:20.543 --> 55:21.713
Really?

946
55:23.313 --> 55:24.713
Okay, I'll be right there.

947
55:31.483 --> 55:32.723
You are free, right?

948
55:36.153 --> 55:38.223
- Really? - Yes.

949
55:39.093 --> 55:43.393
Mu Jin is all alone in the kitchen. He did not expect anyone today,

950
55:43.463 --> 55:46.033
so the prep cook left early.

951
55:48.833 --> 55:51.643
I will go. I will go right now.

952
55:52.073 --> 55:53.073
Okay.

953
56:04.413 --> 56:06.023
Let me help you with that.

954
56:07.353 --> 56:08.753
Excuse me.

955
56:10.093 --> 56:11.693
These buttons need to be fastened properly.

956
56:12.493 --> 56:13.523
Done.

957
56:14.123 --> 56:15.663
- Thank you. - Do not mention it.

958
56:15.993 --> 56:17.093
I am counting on you.

959
56:17.493 --> 56:18.803
I am counting on you too.

960
56:20.263 --> 56:21.303
Of course.

961
56:29.443 --> 56:32.013
Chairman Jang was not wrong at all.

962
56:33.083 --> 56:34.243
What right do you have...

963
56:34.313 --> 56:36.513
to boss him around so boldly?

964
56:37.453 --> 56:39.053
Does he owe you anything?

965
56:41.793 --> 56:43.893
If I were Chairman Jang,

966
56:44.353 --> 56:46.593
I'd never have given someone like you the time of day.

967
56:51.503 --> 56:53.333
You must have starved all day,

968
56:53.933 --> 56:55.573
so just eat something first.

969
56:56.233 --> 56:58.543
Haven't you heard that carbs bring patience...

970
56:58.603 --> 57:00.473
and build good character?

971
57:01.343 --> 57:02.413
I cannot hear you.

972
57:03.173 --> 57:04.173
What?

973
57:05.983 --> 57:07.683
I cannot hear a thing right now,

974
57:07.743 --> 57:10.953
- so stop nagging and just eat. - I cannot do that.

975
57:11.583 --> 57:15.493
Until you shape up, my nagging will continue,

976
57:15.553 --> 57:17.523
until your eardrums literally burst.

977
57:19.293 --> 57:20.963
Right, did that kid Gyu Seo...

978
57:22.133 --> 57:23.293
go to the hospital?

979
57:29.403 --> 57:31.843
Yes. Hey, Gyu Seo.

980
57:32.903 --> 57:34.673
Did you go to the ENT and get properly checked out?

981
57:36.273 --> 57:37.973
You didn't go, did you?

982
57:40.783 --> 57:45.253
Your eardrum ruptured. You need a proper exam,

983
57:45.323 --> 57:47.353
whether you need treatment or surgery,

984
57:47.523 --> 57:49.253
you should do something, you punk.

985
57:50.153 --> 57:51.423
I did go to the hospital.

986
57:51.863 --> 57:53.393
They said nothing is wrong and that I am fine.

987
57:53.963 --> 57:55.593
Do not worry so much, mister.

988
57:56.033 --> 57:57.063
No way.

989
57:57.563 --> 57:59.233
I think this punk is lying.

990
58:00.463 --> 58:01.803
With that much blood coming from your ear,

991
58:01.873 --> 58:03.373
how could you be fine?

992
58:03.933 --> 58:06.203
First thing tomorrow, you and I are going to the hospital...

993
58:07.603 --> 58:08.613
In ten minutes,

994
58:08.713 --> 58:10.073
meet me at the playground Gyeol likes to go to.

995
58:10.313 --> 58:11.583
You are dead if you do not show up.

996
58:12.083 --> 58:13.213
What are you doing?

997
58:25.393 --> 58:26.463
Why are you being so dramatic?

998
58:29.163 --> 58:31.093
Who are you to meddle in someone else's business?

999
58:32.103 --> 58:34.033
Is that any way to talk...

1000
58:34.103 --> 58:35.533
to your brother who got hurt saving you?

1001
58:35.603 --> 58:37.333
Brother? Who is my brother?

1002
58:37.833 --> 58:39.143
Why did you have to do something useless...

1003
58:39.203 --> 58:40.203
that nobody asked you to do?

1004
58:42.113 --> 58:43.813
I do not think what I did was useless.

1005
58:44.243 --> 58:45.243
What?

1006
58:46.943 --> 58:48.883
Even if I could turn back time,

1007
58:49.853 --> 58:51.653
I still would have run over and saved you, Gyu Young.

1008
58:51.753 --> 58:52.753
Hey.

1009
58:52.823 --> 58:54.183
Even if beaten to death, I would have saved you.

1010
58:55.553 --> 58:57.793
Who do you think you are?

1011
58:58.023 --> 59:00.023
Why are you making me feel miserable too?

1012
59:00.493 --> 59:03.563
I am about to lose my mind. Why are you driving me crazy?

1013
59:28.253 --> 59:29.353
Are you an ostrich?

1014
59:29.893 --> 59:31.453
Think hiding your head solves everything?

1015
59:36.393 --> 59:37.393
Why are you crying?

1016
59:38.163 --> 59:39.533
Are you crying because your eye disease hurts?

1017
59:40.303 --> 59:42.973
How can an eye disease hurt? It is my eyes that would hurt.

1018
59:45.273 --> 59:46.443
Either way, why are you crying?

1019
59:46.503 --> 59:47.843
You are breaking your father's heart.

1020
59:49.543 --> 59:50.813
What is wrong with me?

1021
59:51.713 --> 59:53.283
What kind of person am I?

1022
59:57.353 --> 59:58.653
Are you asking me?

1023
59:59.953 --> 01:00:02.093
Why is a grown man so soft?

1024
01:00:03.453 --> 01:00:05.193
Am I soft tofu, like Gyu Min said?

1025
01:00:05.263 --> 01:00:06.523
Am I the biggest pushover in the world?

1026
01:00:06.923 --> 01:00:08.693
Do I have no pride or guts at all?

1027
01:00:09.433 --> 01:00:10.493
Good grief.

1028
01:00:11.393 --> 01:00:14.563
If you do not even know yourself, how could I know you?

1029
01:00:15.033 --> 01:00:16.373
Do not cry, kid.

1030
01:00:16.433 --> 01:00:18.503
Why cry in the middle of the night? A grown man.

1031
01:00:19.173 --> 01:00:22.813
A real man only cries three times in his life.

1032
01:00:22.813 --> 01:00:24.173
Exactly.

1033
01:00:24.343 --> 01:00:26.483
Why on earth am I crying right now?

1034
01:00:28.113 --> 01:00:30.213
Is this even something worth crying over?

1035
01:00:30.513 --> 01:00:32.353
Why am I crying over this?

1036
01:00:33.183 --> 01:00:36.353
What is seriously wrong with me? This is driving me crazy.

1037
01:00:38.893 --> 01:00:41.563
Puberty should have ended in middle school.

1038
01:00:42.693 --> 01:00:43.693
Hey.

1039
01:00:44.233 --> 01:00:46.333
Are you going through male menopause?

1040
01:00:47.333 --> 01:00:48.333
Come on.

1041
01:00:55.143 --> 01:00:56.443
It is definitely menopause.

1042
01:00:56.813 --> 01:00:58.173
Just go, please.

1043
01:01:04.053 --> 01:01:05.223
Total menopause.

1044
01:01:11.053 --> 01:01:12.063
I will handle it that way.

1045
01:01:13.693 --> 01:01:15.193
- Do whatever you want. - Got it.

1046
01:01:15.263 --> 01:01:16.263
Welcome.

1047
01:01:16.933 --> 01:01:18.433
Why do you talk so much when I am treating?

1048
01:01:18.503 --> 01:01:19.503
- Gyu Min. - The food here is great.

1049
01:01:19.563 --> 01:01:21.233
- Right this way, please. - I even skipped lunch for this.

1050
01:01:21.303 --> 01:01:22.373
All right, already.

1051
01:01:24.233 --> 01:01:26.473
- Dad. - Go on in.

1052
01:01:31.073 --> 01:01:32.213
What are you doing here?

1053
01:01:57.603 --> 01:01:59.103
Mu Jin, well...

1054
01:01:59.873 --> 01:02:02.113
The reservation was made by Chairman Jang Hoon Tae.

1055
01:02:02.273 --> 01:02:04.543
- What? - He brought the biggest names...

1056
01:02:04.613 --> 01:02:06.183
from the food and beverage industry.

1057
01:02:07.643 --> 01:02:08.683
Those executives...

1058
01:02:08.753 --> 01:02:11.283
always post restaurant reviews all over social media,

1059
01:02:11.483 --> 01:02:12.823
and they are notorious for their picky palates.

1060
01:02:12.883 --> 01:02:16.253
Did they come to destroy us? Or did they come to save us?

1061
01:02:19.893 --> 01:02:21.223
They must have come to save us.

1062
01:02:31.743 --> 01:02:34.603
(One Way)

1063
01:02:42.913 --> 01:02:46.853
Hey, Gyu Min. I am on my way. It will take about ten minutes.

1064
01:02:47.353 --> 01:02:49.493
Okay, got it. See you soon. Bye.

1065
01:03:52.453 --> 01:03:54.383
(Love on the Menu)

1066
01:03:54.453 --> 01:03:56.023
Instead of you, your family...

1067
01:03:56.093 --> 01:03:58.893
- I will deal with them one by one. - I cut ties with all of them.

1068
01:03:58.963 --> 01:04:00.323
What family do I have?

1069
01:04:00.393 --> 01:04:02.233
Who are you to butt into someone else's family business?

1070
01:04:02.233 --> 01:04:04.333
It is not someone else's business, it is my daughter's.

1071
01:04:04.463 --> 01:04:05.833
- Gyu Rim is my daughter. - What?

1072
01:04:05.833 --> 01:04:08.203
Yes, it is true that I got married, but...

1073
01:04:08.263 --> 01:04:10.803
- Who the heck posted this? - That is not true.

1074
01:04:10.873 --> 01:04:14.203
Gyu Rim, what happened to you? Gyu Young. Gyu Oh.

1075
01:04:14.273 --> 01:04:17.243
I will bring Mu Jin down to rock bottom.

1076
01:04:17.473 --> 01:04:19.143
I will make him come back.
